> I will… sever this deadlock.
> — Chisa
 Chisa is a conscientious, level-headed student from the [[Startorch Academy]]. To her, everything can be broken down, analyzed, and resolved, with the exception of human bonding. Bonds can be severed, but this fragility is what makes them precious.

==Trivia==
* Chisa's last name, Kuchiba is likely a nod to the Uchiha Clan from Naruto. 
===Etymology===
* Kuchiba (朽葉) means withered leaf, while Chisa(千咲) means thousand blossom/blooms.